special={1:'Official P5 Infra body describes transportation investment and operations and names P5 Infra LLC.',6:'Official Pacific Fusion body describes pulsed fusion-system development. Net facility gain and commercial power remain goals rather than established operating results.',12:'Official PSA body explicitly states Parcel Shippers Association is now Package Shippers Association and describes its shipping-industry representation.',14:'Official Padgett body describes accounting, tax, payroll and advisory services through independently owned local offices. Franchise offices are not all treated as the same legal entity.',15:'Official PadSplit body describes weekly shared-room rentals and names PadSplit, Inc. as a public benefit corporation. This form is not nonprofit status; affordability and savings claims are not independently validated.',16:'Official Pair Team About body describes care coordination and separately lists medical groups. Those clinical entities are not merged.',17:'Official Palomar body explicitly names Palomar Display Products, Inc. and describes military displays.',20:'Official Panasonic North America body describes regional technology offerings and names Panasonic Corporation of North America in its footer. Parent and subsidiaries remain distinct.',22:'Official Pano AI body describes wildfire detection and situational-awareness technology. Detection performance is not independently validated.',23:'Official Panorama Education body describes school data and support software. Educational outcomes are not independently verified.',25:'Official Paper Recycling Coalition body identifies recycled-paperboard industry advocacy. Environmental and economic-impact claims are not independently verified.',29:'Official Parents as Teachers body describes home-visiting programs and identifies National Center, Inc. in its footer. Related original filing IDs remain separate in this pass.',30:'Official Parents as Teachers body explicitly names Parents as Teachers National Center, Inc. and describes support for home-visiting affiliates.',31:'Official Parry Labs body describes defense edge software, computing and systems integration. Operational superiority claims are not independently established.',34:'Official Participate Learning body describes cultural-exchange teaching and language programs. Immigration eligibility and program compliance are not independently assessed.',36:'Official Partners for Rural Impact body explicitly describes a national nonprofit and rural-community partnerships.',37:'Official Parts Life body names Parts Life, Inc. and describes reverse engineering, repair and obsolete-part manufacturing.',38:'Official Path Robotics body describes autonomous welding systems. Productivity and cost-reduction claims are not independently verified.',39:'Official PatientPoint body identifies healthcare content and advertising services and names PatientPoint, LLC in its footer. Clinical behavior-change outcomes are not independently validated.',40:'Official Patients Rising body describes patient training and healthcare-policy advocacy.',46:'Official Payactiv body describes earned-wage access and related financial tools. Specific financial-product terms and outcomes are not generalized.',47:'Official Payments Leadership Council body describes chief-executive participation and payments-policy advocacy.',48:'Official Paynela body names Paynela, LLC and describes healthcare affordability, claims and payment technology.',49:'Official PayPal body describes payment and related financial products. Separate banking and cryptocurrency service providers remain distinct.',56:'Official PBM Accountability Project body describes pharmacy-benefit policy advocacy; its characterizations of industry conduct are not treated as independent findings.',63:'Official Peaxy body names Peaxy, Inc. and describes industrial analytics and asset monitoring. Security certifications and reported scale are not independently validated.',65:'Official Pegasus body names Pegasus Support Services, LLC and describes government support, logistics, engineering and healthcare services.',67:'Official Pello Companies body describes fintech advisory and investment access. Market forecasts are not independently established.',70:'Official Penske body explicitly identifies Penske Corporation, Inc. as closely held and describes its transportation businesses. Listed subsidiaries are not all the same ownership or legal entity.',73:'Official PeopleForBikes body describes bicycle infrastructure, policy and participation work.',76:'Official PDW body describes unmanned aircraft, software and training. Announced financing commitments are not completed funding and combat-performance claims are not independently verified.',77:'Official PGL site identifies Perimeter Global Logistics and describes freight, warehousing and supply-chain services. Copied industry-caption mismatches are not used as evidence.',78:'Official PermitFlow body describes permitting workflow software. Approval speed, accuracy and return-on-investment claims are not independently validated.',79:'Official Perseus Defense body describes counter-drone interceptors. Claimed range, price and effectiveness are not independently verified.',80:'Official Persistent Systems, LLC About page describes mobile networking systems, distinct from similarly named software-services companies.',83:'Official PetSmart storefront identifies pet retail products and names PetSmart LLC in the footer.',85:'Official Phantom body describes crypto wallet and trading software. Self-custody and security claims are not independently certified.',86:'Official Phantom Neuro body describes implanted muscle sensing and robotic-device control development. Clinical benefit and safety are not independently established.',91:'Official Pharmacosmos body explicitly names Pharmacosmos Therapeutics Inc. and describes iron and blood-disorder medicines. Family-held group language is not transferred into an unsupported exact ownership change.',93:'Official PharmatrophiX body names PharmatrophiX, Inc. and describes therapies under development. Efficacy and approval are not established.',97:'Official PTTI body identifies Philadelphia Technician Training Institute and lists skilled-trade programs. Job-placement and completion claims are not independently verified.'}
for n,v in enumerate(xs):
 if v['decision']!='confirmed' or n in [26,74,82]:continue
 i=v['id'];assert p[i]['name']==v['original_name'] and p[i]['review_outcome']!='confirmed';before[i]=copy.deepcopy(p[i]);note=special.get(n,'Official organization body text identifies this organization and supports the activity summarized. Existing ownership evidence is retained without inferring additional ownership from its name.')
